#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md
msgid "drizzle, sqlite, libsql, turso, orm, migrations, rescript"
msgstr "drizzle, sqlite, libsql, turso, orm, マイグレーション, rescript"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:7
msgid "Set Up Drizzle"
msgstr "Drizzle のセットアップ"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:9
msgid ""
"The Hono REST, Hono GraphQL, Full-Stack, and Monorepo templates all ship "
"Drizzle ORM with SQLite (via `@libsql/client`). This recipe covers the "
"day-two flow: changing the schema, generating migrations, and pointing at"
" Turso for production."
msgstr ""
"Hono REST、Hono GraphQL、Full-Stack、Monorepo の各テンプレートは、"
"SQLite (`@libsql/client` 経由) + Drizzle ORM を同梱しています。この"
"レシピでは、スキーマ変更、マイグレーション生成、本番環境向けに Turso"
" に向けるといった 2 日目以降のフローを扱います。"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:11
msgid "What You Get"
msgstr "提供されるもの"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:13
msgid ""
"`src/Schema.res` — Drizzle table definitions via `@module(\"drizzle-orm"
"/sqlite-core\")` bindings"
msgstr ""
"`src/Schema.res` — `@module(\"drizzle-orm/sqlite-core\")` バインディング"
"による Drizzle テーブル定義"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:14
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`src/Db.res` — `createClient({url: ...})` + `drizzle(client)` + query "
"helpers"
msgstr ""
"`src/Db.res` — `createClient({url: ...})` + `drizzle(client)` + クエリ"
"ヘルパー"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:15
msgid ""
"`drizzle.config.ts` — drizzle-kit config pointing at the compiled "
"`Schema.res.mjs`"
msgstr ""
"`drizzle.config.ts` — コンパイル済み `Schema.res.mjs` を指す drizzle-kit"
" の設定ファイル"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:16
msgid "`data/app.db` — default local SQLite file (gitignored)"
msgstr "`data/app.db` — デフォルトのローカル SQLite ファイル (gitignore 済み)"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:17
msgid "Scripts — `db:generate`, `db:migrate`"
msgstr "スクリプト — `db:generate`、`db:migrate`"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:19
msgid "Adding a Column"
msgstr "カラムの追加"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:21
msgid "Edit `src/Schema.res`:"
msgstr "`src/Schema.res` を編集します:"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:32
msgid "Regenerate and apply:"
msgstr "再生成して適用します:"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:40
msgid ""
"Commit the generated SQL in `./drizzle/` so collaborators replay the same"
" changes."
msgstr ""
"コラボレーターが同じ変更を再生できるよう、`./drizzle/` に生成された SQL"
" をコミットしてください。"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:42
msgid "Adding a Table"
msgstr "テーブルの追加"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:52
msgid "Same two-step: `pnpm db:generate` then `pnpm db:migrate`."
msgstr "同じ 2 ステップ: `pnpm db:generate` の後に `pnpm db:migrate`。"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:54
msgid "Querying"
msgstr "クエリ"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:56
msgid ""
"The generated `src/Db.res` binds the common verbs you need. Add more via "
"`@send`:"
msgstr ""
"生成された `src/Db.res` は必要な主要動詞をバインドしています。さらに"
"追加する場合は `@send` を使います:"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:64
msgid "Example — find by id:"
msgstr "例 — id で検索する:"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:82
msgid "Pointing at Turso (Production)"
msgstr "Turso へ接続する (本番環境)"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:84
msgid "Turso is a managed libsql host — the same client works with a remote URL."
msgstr ""
"Turso はマネージド libsql ホストです — リモート URL に対しても同じ"
"クライアントが動作します。"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:86
msgid "`brew install tursodatabase/tap/turso`"
msgstr "`brew install tursodatabase/tap/turso`"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:87
msgid "`turso auth login`"
msgstr "`turso auth login`"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:88
msgid "`turso db create my-app`"
msgstr "`turso db create my-app`"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:89
msgid "`turso db tokens create my-app`"
msgstr "`turso db tokens create my-app`"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:90
msgid "Export env vars and run migrations:"
msgstr "環境変数を設定してマイグレーションを実行します:"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:98
msgid "Extend `src/Db.res` to read the auth token:"
msgstr "`src/Db.res` を拡張して認証トークンを読み込みます:"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:109
msgid "Drizzle Config Notes"
msgstr "Drizzle 設定に関する注意"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:111
msgid ""
"`drizzle.config.ts` reads `src/Schema.res.mjs` — the **compiled** file. "
"If migrations come up empty after a schema edit, ensure ReScript has "
"compiled:"
msgstr ""
"`drizzle.config.ts` は **コンパイル済み** の `src/Schema.res.mjs` を"
"読み込みます。スキーマ編集後にマイグレーションが空になる場合は、"
"ReScript がコンパイルされていることを確認してください:"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:117
msgid ""
"Or run `pnpm res:dev` in another terminal so `Schema.res.mjs` stays up to"
" date."
msgstr ""
"あるいは別のターミナルで `pnpm res:dev` を実行して、`Schema.res.mjs` を"
"常に最新に保ちます。"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:119
msgid "Switching Dialects"
msgstr "方言の切り替え"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:121
msgid "To use PostgreSQL instead, replace:"
msgstr "PostgreSQL を使用する場合は、以下を置き換えます:"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:123
msgid "`@libsql/client` → `postgres` (or `pg`)"
msgstr "`@libsql/client` → `postgres` (または `pg`)"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:124
msgid "`drizzle-orm/libsql` → `drizzle-orm/postgres-js`"
msgstr "`drizzle-orm/libsql` → `drizzle-orm/postgres-js`"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:125
msgid "`drizzle-orm/sqlite-core` → `drizzle-orm/pg-core`"
msgstr "`drizzle-orm/sqlite-core` → `drizzle-orm/pg-core`"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:126
msgid "`dialect: \"sqlite\"` → `dialect: \"postgresql\"` in `drizzle.config.ts`"
msgstr "`drizzle.config.ts` で `dialect: \"sqlite\"` → `dialect: \"postgresql\"`"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:128
msgid ""
"The route modules (`Routes/Users.res` etc.) remain unchanged because the "
"query helpers are polymorphic."
msgstr ""
"クエリヘルパーは多相的なため、ルートモジュール (`Routes/Users.res` など)"
" は変更不要です。"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:130
msgid "Common Pitfalls"
msgstr "よくある落とし穴"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:132
msgid ""
"**\"No migrations pending\" after editing the schema** — `drizzle-kit` "
"reads the compiled `.mjs`. Run `res:build` first."
msgstr ""
"**スキーマ編集後に \"No migrations pending\" が出る** — `drizzle-kit` は"
"コンパイル済みの `.mjs` を読むため、先に `res:build` を実行してください。"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:133
msgid ""
"**Lock conflicts with watch mode** — stop `res:dev` before `db:migrate` "
"if you hit file-lock errors on Windows."
msgstr ""
"**ウォッチモードとのロック競合** — Windows でファイルロックエラーが出る"
"場合、`db:migrate` の前に `res:dev` を停止してください。"

#: ../../user/recipes/setup-drizzle.md:134
msgid ""
"**Foreign key constraints** — SQLite doesn't enforce them by default. "
"Call `PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;` at connection time if you need "
"enforcement."
msgstr ""
"**外部キー制約** — SQLite はデフォルトでは外部キー制約を強制しません。"
"必要な場合は接続時に `PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;` を実行してください。"

